***REMOVED******REMOVED*** Secrets (Bitwarden Secrets Manager)

Secrets live in Bitwarden Secrets Manager, accessed via a machine-account access token (`SM_ACCESS_TOKEN` env or `~/.config/bitw/config` key `sm_access_token`). All keys namespaced under `zet/`. The `secrets-render.yml` playbook fetches them by key on the workstation. See `ansible/vault.yml` for the full key table. Key items: `zet/minimax-api-key`, `zet/hermes-discord-token`, `zet/tailscale-authkey`, `zet/vps-ssh-key`, `zet/domain-config`, `zet/tofu-inputs`.

One item stays in the **personal vault** (not SM): `zet/tofu-state-snapshot` — written by `scripts/snapshot-state.sh` (SM is read-only for this repo's automation).

